[{"title":"蓉湖秋月","author":"邹士随","text":"芙蓉湖上月光浮，独坐凭栏万象收。\n茶灶笔床三尺席，白蘋红蓼一滩秋。\n风流已散春申履，潮信还催范蠡舟。\n何似阮湘投佩客，每拈芳草忆灵修。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31097,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"薄暮游海会寺","author":"邹承垣","text":"大地山河四望通，公余乘兴访崆峒。\n人来碧嶂清江外，犬吠幽篱曲径中。\n瑶岛波连天共远，海门云吐月当空。\n昔年歌舞今安在，只听萧萧落木风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31098,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"甲子俸满除夕","author":"邹承垣","text":"如何五十未知非，万里风霜点客衣。\n柏叶有情凭夜醉，梅花相约待春归。\n暂抛冰案寻书卷，长卧茅斋掩竹扉。\n一榻炉烟堪作伴，闲阶只喜吏人稀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31099,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆溪湖","author":"邹永绥","text":"五里清波范蠡湖，秋风又起忆莼鲈。\n多稌委积排山坞，连网铺张截水区。\n菱角鸡头争上市，鹅群雁阵共依芦。\n投簪归去身原乐，谁笑邹生一故吾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31100,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"喜念祖同宝之到滇","author":"邹永绥","text":"父子追随定省来，路长天冷雪皑皑。\n山中屡欲探梅信，客里无须劝酒杯。\n老矣而翁皮骨尽，勖哉犹望子孙才。\n剥穷复反循环理，试看春风启冻荄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31101,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"腾越八阙之内沃野千里可屯田以充兵饷而省运粮之费惜无人筹及以永保边疆因长言以志之","author":"邹越","text":"缅傀生奸忽跳梁，屯田自可足仓箱。\n八关尽有闲田地，千里皆堪供稻粮。\n士马饱腾军气奋，刍茭充裕守陴强。\n何须月下量沙唱，充国金城筹画长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31102,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"万松寺","author":"邹云城","text":"一片秋光冷万松，松云浓绿沁寒筇。\n便骑白鹤游天上，缅邈风涛压暮钟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31103,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"天香寺","author":"邹云城","text":"天香何似木樨香，香雨溟濛下石床。\n说与道人浑不解，倾翻银汉桂为浆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31104,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"尤文简公遂初堂","author":"邹乾枢","text":"荒基断础足凄凉，道是先生旧讲堂。\n早向东林推入室，晚于南宋号灵光。\n一生著述源何远，四世丝纶泽更长。\n我亦斋心探道脉，每从祠下肃冠裳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31105,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阖闾城","author":"邹乾枢","text":"茂苑吴宫已劫灰，湖干雉堞满蒿莱。\n一抔土在留遗筑，三让风微出霸才。\n隐隐波涛豗震泽，踆踆麋鹿走荒台。\n坞中剩有桃千树，每到春风次第开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31106,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渡铁索桥","author":"邹志伊","text":"险矣盘江路，何年铁索桥。\n古藤援旅客，绝壁束秋潮。\n绿涧呼蛮部，垂虹溯汉朝。\n风枝浑不定，为问挂猿条。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31107,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"澄江夜泊","author":"邹志伊","text":"人依孤树宿，雁落一滩秋。\n渺渺苍葭外，萧萧古渡头。\n乾坤悬夜色，星月定江流。\n遂有飞扬意，乘槎犯斗牛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31108,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"社集石浪庵山楼","author":"邹志伊","text":"不尽湖中浪，翻光上石坡。\n风过仍叠巘，云涌更层波。\n客杖穿螺黛，僧房锁薜萝。\n楼高衔日月，窗小纳山河。\n梅信先伸约，松声欲和歌。\n招携同谢朓，结契及维摩。\n击钵诗成未，擎杯兴若何。\n几番吟社里，佳景上方多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31109,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月夜登钓台","author":"邹清","text":"钓台临绝壁，夜坐峭寒侵。\n木落山容瘦，峰凹月色深。\n足曾加帝腹，水自鉴臣心。\n圣世宁高蹈，低回听濑音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31110,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"学圃堂遗兴","author":"邹清","text":"南园一径已荒芜，一日来樵一束刍。\n拳石垒成山意画，楛渠开到水萦纡。\n平坡好植千竿竹，浅汭堪栽半亩蔬。\n汲井浇花亲抱瓮，个农原是带经锄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31111,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题顾晴沙给谏风草图即送出守宁夏","author":"邹奕孝","text":"少小事铅椠，声华富文藻。\n长通金闺籍，数上明光表。\n监门图既绘，汲暗诏非矫。\n生逢尧舜君，克展禹稷抱。\n我疑万言书，犹有未定稿。\n一朝天符下，双旌指新堡。\n文章通政事，作图号风草。\n鲁论引尚书，妙理恣探讨。\n屠龙手殊钜，雕虫技则小。\n开图读高文，妙笔见先兆。\n青青河畔行，了了见河套。\n微微动春飔，荡荡尊王道。\n王道其如何，王民看皞皞。\n送君今作郡，我心殊悄悄。\n钦哉尔惟风，刍荛谅为宝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31112,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梅里古城","author":"邹梦皋","text":"欲问勾吴事，平墟一望中。\n水流空世德，云暗失遗宫。\n药路遵微径，蛮荒溯古风。\n野梅香不断，樵唱入鸿蒙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31113,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"村居杂咏六首 其一","author":"邹起凤","text":"暂结渔樵侣，相逢似旧邻。\n多怀烟水趣，却愧宦游人。\n鸡黍间中味，桑麻世外身。\n终身五湖畔，潇洒乐吾真。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31114,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"村居杂咏六首 其二","author":"邹起凤","text":"屏迹荒郊外，逍遥绝世缘。\n立残千顷月，钓破一溪烟。\n鹿卧青山稳，花开白昼妍。\n古来传吏隐，从此得真诠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31115,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"村居杂咏六首 其三","author":"邹起凤","text":"绝壑渺无际，迂回路几层。\n偶来寻古迹，回首失前村。\n待月穿松径，沿钟到寺门。\n绳床趺坐久，清磬半黄昏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31116,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"村居杂咏六首 其四","author":"邹起凤","text":"野田新霁后，散步足徜徉。\n戏水鱼知暖，寻花蝶抱香。\n芹泥添燕垒，柳叶啭莺簧。\n遥忆龙山畔，春风旧草堂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31117,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"村居杂咏六首 其五","author":"邹起凤","text":"今日春光好，晴郊看采桑。\n掺掺垂素手，缓缓出微行。\n有意悲公子，何心恋懿筐。\n夕阳归去晚，春恨满陂塘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31118,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"村居杂咏六首 其六","author":"邹起凤","text":"独饮不成醉，闲吟兴亦阑。\n乡心归梦杳，春意落花残。\n未便幽栖好，还忧行路难。\n江州风雪满，何处着征鞍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31119,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黄埠墩","author":"邹方锷","text":"平江八百平如掌，漠漠清阴两岸苔。\n突兀孤亭撑水出，九龙衔下一珠来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31120,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月轮山","author":"邹方锷","text":"渺渺江枫漠漠台，珠帘绣柱拂云开。\n已看十二瑶台近，空说三千铁弩回。\n无数烟樯飞鸟外，横空山翠逼人来。\n振衣却立重回首，下界坳堂只一杯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31121,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"十八涧","author":"邹方锷","text":"青苍竹柏压香台，匹马西风得得来。\n一径万千峰下路，九溪十八涧边回。\n泠泠钟梵寒云合，淡淡山花雪照开。\n世外仙源寻已遍，不知何处是蓬莱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31122,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望湖上远山","author":"邹思成","text":"缥缈峰如云脚垂，一痕难禁晓风吹。\n长卿病起支颐看，爱煞文君镜里眉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31123,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望太湖用东坡海市歌韵","author":"邹思成","text":"汪洋万顷连高空，名都环拱湖当中。\n重重叠嶂插天起，千堆雪卷翻蛟宫。\n具区胜概擅六合，使我得句难为工。\n登高纵目发豪兴，直欲散发骑苍龙。\n苍龙潭底眠未醒，狎鸥且共忘机翁。\n矶头兀坐忘岁月，云气开阖心增雄。\n囊中风月收不尽，何哉迂士悲途穷。\n但知银屋波光好，不问金阙春光融。\n羊裘典去换美酒，何须厚糈过千钟。\n潜虬起舞怒涛涌，伏波战鼓初镕铜。\n冲波一叶疾于驶，腹满稳使蒲帆风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31124,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暮春","author":"倪素玉","text":"片片残红漾碧溪，卷帘人立小窗西。\n无情最是枝头鸟，落尽春花只管啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31125,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日","author":"倪素玉","text":"清光如拭绿筠窝，天气新凉透薄罗。\n门外秋风落桐叶，夕阳影里雁行多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31126,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江亭野望","author":"倪素玉","text":"闲眺江亭上，清光满目前。\n远帆晴霭里，归雁夕阳边。\n云拥寒岩树，风回野寺烟。\n芦滩维钓艇，渔夫枕蓑眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31127,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"潞河道中述怀留别京师诸故人","author":"邹鸣鹤","text":"回首金门倚碧穹，几番去住笑匆匆。\n酸咸世味亲尝后，蚕蚁功名感慨中。\n捧檄稍舒慈母望，鸣弦窃慕古贤风。\n隆隆虚誉何时雪，揽辔苍茫默抚躬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31128,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咸丰癸丑二月初九日贼攻金陵愈急见势难支即手书绝命词二首 其一","author":"邹鸣鹤","text":"臣力难图报称，臣心仰答九重。\n三次守城尽节，庶几全始全终。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31129,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咸丰癸丑二月初九日贼攻金陵愈急见势难支即手书绝命词二首 其二","author":"邹鸣鹤","text":"太仓半粒粟，沧海一微尘。\n人生百年耳，忠尽仁乃纯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31130,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题黄粱仙迹","author":"邹钺","text":"策马邯郸谒古祠，浮生入梦复谁知。\n男儿不到封侯日，总是黄粱未熟时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31131,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"代人题桐阴课子图小照","author":"邹钺","text":"崭然头角已峥嵘，一卷传薪卜凤鸣。\n最是眼前真趣永，树声相和读书声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31132,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓起舟行村坞中","author":"邹若媛","text":"一村通略彴，欲往翠微重。\n茅屋萝全补，竹篱云半封。\n溪声咽残月，山色破寒钟。\n早有鸟惊起，幽人策短筇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31133,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"延清阁夜坐","author":"邹若媛","text":"虚绿摇窗镜影空，庭梧瑟瑟剪秋风。\n水晶帘外朦胧月，人在秋江碧练中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31134,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送春","author":"邹若媛","text":"乍寒乍暖落花天，好景全消又一年。\n蝶影飘残桃底露，莺声啼破柳梢烟。\n休弹锦瑟伤青鬓，谁向红楼惜翠钿。\n惆怅王孙归路杳，任他茅草自芊绵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31135,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乙卯送别","author":"邹佩兰","text":"天上星辰合，人间乞巧时；自嗟方识面，已赋别离诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31136,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"离别","author":"邹佩兰","text":"澹云微月映银河，料得双星别恨多。\n莫怪人间增怅望，从知天上也蹉跎。\n金针争乞天孙巧，云锦停抛织女梭。\n底事盈盈隔秋水，一年只许一经过。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31137,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己未送别","author":"邹佩兰","text":"一片轻帆送客船，迢迢北去路三千。\n明知重晤时非远，怎奈将离恨已牵。\n雁塔题名应有分，萤窗攻苦记多年。\n愿君勿惜修书纸，两字平安值万钱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31138,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登惠山仙人坞","author":"刘继增","text":"峭壁千寻矗，清泉一线飞。\n片云出空谷，孤鹤守禅扉。\n野旷乔松老，山高曲径微。\n莫言尘世客，到此也忘机。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31139,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蔡云汀澍同学乱中过访同步青祁渰即景各赋","author":"刘继增","text":"欲访野人家，柔桑一路遮。\n断桥春水溢，古树夕阳斜。\n山色迎眉黛，湖光映脸霞。\n坠欢何处拾，沽酒问梨花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31140,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"湖滨秋夜破屋独坐","author":"刘继增","text":"细雨斜风冷不支，更残有客梦醒时。\n草深野岸蛙传鼓，月暗虚堂鬼唱诗。\n灯影渐辞人影去，愁肠争与热肠持。\n眼前况味凭谁解，合付颓垣断井知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31141,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闰中秋谒翁叔平先生，归后俞调卿以所和诗见示，依韵奉简二首 其一","author":"刘继增","text":"尚湖烟水足清游，容与西泾一榻留。\n消渴马卿常慕蔺，怀归王粲倦依刘。\n蘧蘧梦境隍中鹿，泛泛渔人岸上舟。\n最是后凋松柏好，满天落叶不知秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31142,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闰中秋谒翁叔平先生，归后俞调卿以所和诗见示，依韵奉简二首 其二","author":"刘继增","text":"催诗小雨入城来，座上欣瞻霁色开。\n未拟围棋输别墅，且从初服赋天台。\n遣愁应有《高僧传》，望古宁无国士才？\n欲傍层楼事宏景，西山猿鹤莫相猜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31143,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"惠山竹枝词五首 其一","author":"刘继增","text":"丛坟垒垒碧山腰，吟社风流迹已消。\n日暮谁家作寒食，纸钱灰起隔林飘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31144,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"惠山竹枝词五首 其二","author":"刘继增","text":"点易台荒古砚凹，海天石屋掩蓬茅。\n游人到此无聊甚，石上纵横画卦爻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31145,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"惠山竹枝词五首 其三","author":"刘继增","text":"桂花大栗松花菌，湖水鲜菱泉水醪。\n更有青青蚕豆子，山家风味胜羊羔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31146,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"惠山竹枝词五首 其四","author":"刘继增","text":"秀嶂街横树色参，钟声塔影落层岚。\n只因地僻游人少，香火寥寥忍草庵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31147,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"惠山竹枝词五首 其五","author":"刘继增","text":"一篮土产客中添，五彩泥人样巧纤。\n耍货招牌高挂起，儿童欢喜价难廉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31148,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登杨家城得神松旧处","author":"刘世瑞","text":"欲寻神木识根由，直上馋崖到此游。\n好溯金时初建寨，还徵宋相旧题楼。\n勋传柱国杨家将，说误槎仙博望侯。\n更莫浪称松见处，山城改徙自云州。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31149,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌鲁木齐杂诗之物产 其一","author":"纪昀","text":"种出东陵子母瓜，伊州佳种莫相夸。\n凉争冰雪甜争蜜，消得温暾顾渚茶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31150,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌鲁木齐杂诗之物产 其二","author":"纪昀","text":"夜深宝气满山头，玛纳斯南半紫镠。\n两载惊心驰羽檄，春冰消后似防秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31151,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌鲁木齐杂诗之物产 其三","author":"纪昀","text":"凯渡河鱼八尺长，分明风味似鲟鳇。\n西秦只解红羊鲊，特乞仓公制脍方。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31152,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌鲁木齐杂诗之物产 其四","author":"纪昀","text":"红笠乌衫担侧挑，苹婆杏子绿蒲桃。\n谁知只重中原味，榛栗楂梨价最高。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31153,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌鲁木齐杂诗之物产 其五","author":"纪昀","text":"甘瓜别种碧团栾，错作花门小笠看。\n午梦初回微渴后，嚼来真似水晶寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31154,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌鲁木齐杂诗之物产 其六","author":"纪昀","text":"腊雪深深坼地寒，经冬宿麦换苗难。\n农家都是春初种，一样黄云被垄看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31155,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌鲁木齐杂诗之物产 其七","author":"纪昀","text":"收麦初完收谷忙，三春却不入官仓。\n可怜粒粒珍珠滑，人道多输饼饵香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31156,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌鲁木齐杂诗之物产 其八","author":"纪昀","text":"温泉东畔火荧荧，扑面山风铁气腥。\n只怪红炉三度炼，十分才剩一分零。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31157,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌鲁木齐杂诗之物产 其九","author":"纪昀","text":"澄彻戎盐出水涯，分明青玉净无瑕。\n犹嫌不及交河产，一色轻红似杏花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31158,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌鲁木齐杂诗之物产 其十","author":"纪昀","text":"云母窗棂片片明，往来人在镜中行。\n七盘峻坂顽如铁，山骨何缘似水精？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31159,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌鲁木齐杂诗之物产 其十一","author":"纪昀","text":"凿破云根石窦开，朝朝煤户到城来。\n北山更比西山好，须辨寒炉一夜灰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31160,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌鲁木齐杂诗之物产 其十二","author":"纪昀","text":"依依红柳满滩沙，颜色何曾似绛霞。\n若与绿杨为伴侣，蜡梅通谱到梅花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31161,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌鲁木齐杂诗之物产 其十三","author":"纪昀","text":"露叶翻翻翠色铺，小园多种淡巴菰。\n红潮晕颊浓于酒，别调氤氲亦自殊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31162,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌鲁木齐杂诗之物产 其十四","author":"纪昀","text":"山珍入馔只寻常，处处深林是猎场。\n若与分明评次第，野骡风味胜黄羊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31163,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌鲁木齐杂诗之物产 其十五","author":"纪昀","text":"西到宁边东阜康，狐踪处处认微茫。\n谋衣却比羊裘易，粲粲临风一色黄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31164,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌鲁木齐杂诗之物产 其十六","author":"纪昀","text":"月黑风高迅似飞，秋田熟处野猪肥。\n诸军火器年年给，不为天山看打围。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31165,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]